{
  "$comment": "Enemies, from the D&D 5e SRD monster blocks (source; creature: its SRD creature type). ranged: the bows a share of them carry instead (they shoot from afar). spellcaster: casts the heroes' spells as a caster of that class and ability, at the party's level (systems/EnemyRangedSystem.ts). health: hit points. ac: Armor Class. proficiency: proficiency bonus (+2 up to challenge 4, +3 from 5). abilities: the six scores (modifiers are worked out from them). weapons: the low-end weapons each one may carry, picked at random when it spawns (names from src/rules/WeaponTable.ts); it attacks with d20 + proficiency + STR (DEX for finesse) and deals the weapon's dice + the same modifier. xp: experience for the kill (SRD, by challenge rating; the party shares it). deathPoints: what the coins it drops are worth. throwables: the flasks a share of them carry to throw at the heroes (src/data/throwables.json; one each). defences (SRD): the damage types it resists (half), is immune to (none) or vulnerable to (double); resistNonmagical: the weapon damage it resists only from nonmagical weapons (rules/Resistances.ts; prepared, not applied in play yet). conditions: the conditions it is immune to (rules/Conditions.ts: a specter or a shadow never falls prone, nor slips on grease; an undead never sleeps). The heroes are in classes.json.",
